WEBVTT

01:47.640 --> 01:50.480
Madam Wang, why bring the grinding stone?

01:50.560 --> 01:54.320
It's all I have left of my husband.

01:54.400 --> 01:55.240
It can't be burnt.

01:55.320 --> 01:56.560
Stones won't be burnt.

01:56.640 --> 01:58.560
Madam Wang,
where would you like it placed?

01:59.280 --> 02:00.360
Over there.

02:01.240 --> 02:02.360
Let me handle it.

02:03.000 --> 02:04.640
Age has caught up with me.

02:05.920 --> 02:07.200
- Take it easy.
- Alright.

02:09.080 --> 02:10.479
- Put it here.
- Alright.

02:11.480 --> 02:13.040
Here then, Madam Wang.

02:13.120 --> 02:14.480
- Here.
- Thank you.

02:14.560 --> 02:15.640
You're welcome.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.360
- Here.
- Thank you.

02:23.200 --> 02:24.040
Here.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.360
Thank you.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.560
I want a bowl, too.

02:29.160 --> 02:30.000
Here.

02:35.480 --> 02:36.600
What's the matter?

02:37.480 --> 02:39.120
You look impressive in your armor.

02:42.320 --> 02:44.160
I can't shame the Weibei Army.

03:01.480 --> 03:02.840
Wei,

03:02.920 --> 03:05.600
the water's for the soldiers
and villagers logging in the forest.

03:05.680 --> 03:06.800
Alright, I'll deliver it.

03:06.880 --> 03:08.560
Steady now. Don't spill the water.

03:08.640 --> 03:09.760
Don't worry.

03:12.080 --> 03:13.040
I'll assist them.

03:18.280 --> 03:19.120
Thank you.

03:51.280 --> 03:52.480
Your Excellency.

04:04.680 --> 04:05.760
Your Excellency.

04:06.680 --> 04:07.760
Your Excellency,

04:07.840 --> 04:09.600
the city civilians, including the elderly,
women, and children,

04:09.680 --> 04:11.280
are all sheltered.

04:11.360 --> 04:13.760
But the villagers are arriving
with all their belongings,

04:13.840 --> 04:16.120
and space at the Monument of the Masses
is entirely full.

04:17.240 --> 04:19.000
The remaining civilians
will relocate to the yamen.

04:24.480 --> 04:25.320
Your Excellency,

04:26.800 --> 04:28.760
fire spreads swiftly, and we lack loggers.

04:28.840 --> 04:30.280
Reassign guard troops
to assist with logging.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.280
Yes.

04:42.960 --> 04:47.520
Miss, Prince Jing sent me
to check your health.

04:48.920 --> 04:49.760
Sir,

05:00.880 --> 05:02.040
actually,

05:02.600 --> 05:04.640
the Momai poison lingers.

05:06.280 --> 05:08.640
Your prescription can't save me.

05:08.720 --> 05:09.600
How could it be?

05:09.680 --> 05:12.600
I examined you closely.

05:12.680 --> 05:14.760
The poison was neutralized.

05:15.600 --> 05:17.000
It's a long story.

05:18.480 --> 05:21.840
Once the war ends,
I'll explain to Prince Jing.

05:22.880 --> 05:24.080
Until then,

05:24.640 --> 05:26.160
please keep this hidden.

05:26.920 --> 05:28.480
- Well…
- Sir,

05:29.080 --> 05:30.040
I beg you.

05:31.400 --> 05:33.240
It's a critical moment for Qingzhou.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.280
Prince Jing must not be distracted now.

05:36.800 --> 05:38.400
You're weak from Qi deficiency
and night sweats.

05:38.480 --> 05:39.800
Concealing this

05:39.880 --> 05:42.360
from Prince Jing may be difficult.

05:43.760 --> 05:46.440
Is there a way to suppress it?

05:49.400 --> 05:53.920
Stimulating the Hegu acupoint
with a silver needle

05:54.000 --> 05:57.960
might help, but it's painful.

05:58.040 --> 06:01.240
I can endure it. For Qingzhou's sake,

06:01.320 --> 06:02.880
I'll try any method.

06:05.080 --> 06:07.280
Physician, someone fainted.

06:07.360 --> 06:09.640
Alright. I'll see to it, Miss.

06:09.720 --> 06:11.000
- Hurry.
- Go.

06:11.080 --> 06:12.840
Madam, wake up.

06:12.920 --> 06:14.440
- What's the issue?
- Physician. Please examine her.

06:14.520 --> 06:15.400
Alright.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.760
Father,

06:20.400 --> 06:25.040
protect us from heaven
and help Qingzhou through this crisis.

06:25.120 --> 06:26.280
Father,

06:26.360 --> 06:28.480
protect us and help us
overcome this crisis.

06:28.560 --> 06:30.520
Please protect us.

06:31.720 --> 06:32.560
Don't worry.

06:32.640 --> 06:34.480
The Weibei Army will protect Qingzhou.

06:44.840 --> 06:45.760
Father,

06:47.240 --> 06:48.280
Mother,

06:50.520 --> 06:52.680
we will defend Qingzhou.

06:56.040 --> 06:59.440
GOVERNOR'S MANSION

07:00.040 --> 07:01.480
Reports indicate that

07:01.560 --> 07:03.360
Mingju has mobilized

07:03.440 --> 07:05.400
three Xiyan tribes against Qingzhou.

07:06.080 --> 07:09.800
Tomorrow, 30,000 men
will gather across the Liucui River.

07:10.520 --> 07:12.960
Containing the fire is our first priority.

07:13.040 --> 07:13.920
Yes.

07:25.720 --> 07:26.960
How is her health?

07:28.000 --> 07:29.760
Her weakness is due to overwork.

07:29.840 --> 07:31.440
She should recover with rest.

07:31.520 --> 07:33.200
My lord, I take my leave.

07:37.080 --> 07:38.000
I'm fine.

07:39.160 --> 07:40.760
I'm only tired.

07:41.760 --> 07:44.080
After acupuncture,

07:44.600 --> 07:45.800
I feel much better.

07:46.960 --> 07:50.280
Jia needs help, so I must go.

07:51.000 --> 07:52.400
I'm really fine.

07:53.440 --> 07:55.920
If I don't go,
she'll think I'm being lazy.

07:59.320 --> 08:00.880
I'll accompany you.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.000
Very well.

08:17.960 --> 08:21.800
‪YAN

08:53.920 --> 08:55.360
Are you worried about General Yin?

09:02.080 --> 09:03.440
Didn't I ask you to rest?

09:04.240 --> 09:05.160
Why are you here again?

09:07.040 --> 09:09.400
The physician used acupuncture
to ease my fatigue.

09:10.200 --> 09:11.240
I'm alright.

09:15.280 --> 09:16.160
Are you hungry?

09:21.160 --> 09:23.800
You barely ate earlier.

09:23.880 --> 09:25.240
You must be hungry now.

09:39.880 --> 09:41.400
What happened to your hand?

09:42.560 --> 09:44.280
I was helping to contain the fire.

09:45.280 --> 09:46.480
The medicine's applied.

09:49.120 --> 09:50.160
Does it hurt?

09:50.960 --> 09:51.880
No.

10:01.160 --> 10:02.640
Eat while it's warm.

10:17.240 --> 10:18.680
You eat first.

10:44.160 --> 10:46.320
Night's cold. Wear more layers.

11:23.160 --> 11:25.600
YOUWEN RIDGE

11:42.840 --> 11:44.400
Enemy sighted!

13:37.160 --> 13:38.360
Mount up!

13:47.840 --> 13:48.680
Jiangtu!

13:48.760 --> 13:51.320
Hurry and go, General!

13:57.560 --> 13:58.760
Chase after her.

14:17.640 --> 14:19.200
As you predicted,

14:20.200 --> 14:23.280
the Great Yan forces at the Liucui River

14:23.360 --> 14:25.520
are largely civilians.

14:26.160 --> 14:28.240
Most soldiers of the Weibei Army

14:28.320 --> 14:29.400
have been dispatched to log

14:29.480 --> 14:31.400
to contain the fire.

14:33.720 --> 14:35.040
Qingzhou

14:35.120 --> 14:38.120
can't endure another fire.

14:38.200 --> 14:40.440
General Weibei has no other choice.

14:40.520 --> 14:41.640
Yes.

14:41.720 --> 14:44.520
The southwest wind will blow
for three more days,

14:44.600 --> 14:47.280
directly affecting Qingzhou.

14:48.040 --> 14:51.320
If the fire spreads, the city may be lost.

14:53.440 --> 14:56.800
By then, taking Qingzhou
will be effortless.

14:56.880 --> 14:59.760
But I won't wait.

15:00.360 --> 15:01.680
You mean…?

15:01.760 --> 15:02.800
The fire attack

15:02.880 --> 15:06.920
was meant to pin down the Weibei Army.

15:07.000 --> 15:08.560
I never intended

15:08.640 --> 15:11.520
to burn the mountains as a strategy.

15:11.600 --> 15:13.120
Murong Jinghe assumes

15:13.200 --> 15:16.040
we won't cross the Liucui River

15:16.120 --> 15:19.000
and has only civilians guarding it.

15:19.680 --> 15:22.720
This chance cannot be missed.

15:22.800 --> 15:26.000
When will you strike?

15:26.080 --> 15:29.640
Tonight, we'll cross to build a bridge
for the Xiyan forces.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.440
At dawn,

15:31.520 --> 15:33.640
I'll lead a fraction

15:34.600 --> 15:38.760
of our troops and seize Qingzhou.

15:46.480 --> 15:48.520
Contain the fire by dawn.

15:49.360 --> 15:50.200
Protect the women and children.

15:52.240 --> 15:55.240
Let's go.

15:59.320 --> 16:01.240
YAN

16:17.360 --> 16:18.960
Enemy sighted! Full alert!

16:29.200 --> 16:30.560
Attack!

16:40.040 --> 16:43.360
Kill them!

16:55.560 --> 16:56.440
Release the arrows!

17:03.360 --> 17:04.599
Kill them!

17:07.760 --> 17:11.160
Kill them!

17:21.880 --> 17:26.119
Kill them!

17:29.120 --> 17:33.160
QINGZHOU

17:33.240 --> 17:34.920
Hurry up and go.

17:38.680 --> 17:39.720
Here.

17:41.320 --> 17:43.320
Here. He's still breathing.

17:43.400 --> 17:44.240
Hurry up.

17:45.520 --> 17:46.360
Come.

17:48.440 --> 17:50.840
- Take it easy.
- I'll leave him to you.

17:54.200 --> 17:55.080
Uncle,

17:55.160 --> 17:56.960
have any casualties not been removed?

17:57.040 --> 17:58.120
All have been carried out.

17:58.200 --> 18:00.720
Only the fallen soldiers remain.

18:01.520 --> 18:03.560
Big Guy. Big Guy.

18:04.160 --> 18:05.040
Big Guy.

18:06.440 --> 18:07.600
Big…

18:19.560 --> 18:20.600
Jia.

18:21.920 --> 18:22.960
Big Guy.

18:24.600 --> 18:25.520
Jia.

18:26.560 --> 18:27.600
Big Guy.

18:33.240 --> 18:34.520
Big Guy.

18:34.600 --> 18:35.880
Big Guy.

18:35.960 --> 18:38.840
Big Guy, wake up. Big Guy.

18:39.560 --> 18:41.360
Big Guy.

18:42.480 --> 18:44.680
Wake up.

18:45.480 --> 18:48.160
Get up.

18:48.240 --> 18:50.720
Get up, Big Guy.

18:52.520 --> 18:55.080
Big Guy, get up.

19:10.240 --> 19:12.960
Get up.

19:13.040 --> 19:17.480
You said you'd always be with me!

19:18.080 --> 19:19.560
Wake up.

19:19.640 --> 19:21.640
Get up.

19:23.040 --> 19:26.560
Wake up, Big Guy.

19:27.400 --> 19:30.720
Big Guy, wake up.

19:30.800 --> 19:32.640
We will defend Qingzhou with our lives

19:33.400 --> 19:35.360
and honor their sacrifice.

19:48.560 --> 19:51.640
I underestimated General Weibei.

19:51.720 --> 19:52.920
We've walked into a trap.

19:53.000 --> 19:54.360
Those civilians on the walls

19:54.440 --> 19:55.600
are disguised soldiers.

19:56.200 --> 19:57.520
Reports said

19:58.120 --> 19:59.800
Qingzhou had under a thousand defenders,

20:00.400 --> 20:01.760
but it seems

20:03.040 --> 20:06.000
reinforcements may have entered the city.

20:06.920 --> 20:09.440
Once the fire spreads,

20:09.520 --> 20:12.400
let's see how long they last.

20:13.520 --> 20:14.560
Pass my order.

20:15.520 --> 20:16.680
Postpone the attack.

20:16.760 --> 20:17.720
Yes.

20:18.640 --> 20:22.160
QINGZHOU

20:37.000 --> 20:39.720
How did you know Mingju would withdraw?

20:40.400 --> 20:41.920
He's naturally cautious.

20:42.000 --> 20:43.520
The empty city ruse works only once.

20:44.120 --> 20:45.720
If he learns our true numbers,

20:46.400 --> 20:48.080
we won't last half a day.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.560
Great!

20:54.640 --> 20:55.960
Great!

20:56.040 --> 20:57.800
The mountain fire is contained.

20:57.880 --> 20:58.880
We have succeeded.

20:58.960 --> 21:00.520
Qingzhou will be safe.

21:00.600 --> 21:01.640
Yes.

21:01.720 --> 21:03.600
Great!

21:03.680 --> 21:05.920
- Great!
- Qingyan, prepare a feast.

21:08.640 --> 21:11.520
‪Great, we're saved!

21:52.320 --> 21:53.160
Men,

21:54.280 --> 21:57.760
tomorrow, General Yin
will bring reinforcements.

21:57.840 --> 22:01.800
But the Xiyan army may attack before dawn.

22:02.400 --> 22:04.360
Qingzhou's forces are weak.

22:04.440 --> 22:06.720
Defense alone won't suffice.

22:06.800 --> 22:08.440
Thus, I've resolved

22:09.000 --> 22:11.800
to strike the Xiyan camp tonight.

22:17.920 --> 22:20.600
By halting their advance,

22:20.680 --> 22:23.760
we can secure time
for reinforcements to arrive.

22:28.400 --> 22:29.680
Men,

22:32.040 --> 22:34.160
in Qingzhou's peril,

22:34.240 --> 22:37.320
let the loyalty of the Weibei Army
be our shield

22:37.400 --> 22:38.600
and our courage our spear,

22:38.680 --> 22:42.400
defending our people and land.

22:56.440 --> 22:57.800
General, be assured.

22:57.880 --> 23:00.920
Tonight, I'll kill every single one I see.

23:01.000 --> 23:02.320
I'll take down at least ten.

23:02.400 --> 23:04.480
Yang, you're getting timid.

23:04.560 --> 23:06.280
Why stop at ten?

23:07.880 --> 23:10.120
Kill ten, and I'll get ten taels.

23:10.200 --> 23:14.280
Enough for that jade bracelet
my daughter wants.

23:14.360 --> 23:15.720
I'll aim for a hundred.

23:15.800 --> 23:18.920
My mother dreams of a big house
on Qinglin Lane.

23:19.000 --> 23:20.320
You are ambitious.

23:21.440 --> 23:22.800
Qingzhou is our home.

23:23.640 --> 23:25.600
Did you join the army for this?

23:26.520 --> 23:27.360
Mr. Yuan,

23:27.880 --> 23:30.520
we fight for better lives,

23:31.320 --> 23:32.600
for ourselves

23:32.680 --> 23:36.200
and for those we leave behind.

23:37.080 --> 23:39.640
Any special wishes
beyond the usual rewards?

23:39.720 --> 23:42.040
Let Qingyan record them.

23:42.120 --> 23:43.080
But…

23:44.280 --> 23:45.320
I hope

23:46.520 --> 23:48.000
each of you

23:48.080 --> 23:49.840
returns alive to claim your reward.

23:49.920 --> 23:51.800
General, I'd like a post in Zhaojing.

23:51.880 --> 23:53.040
Granted.

23:53.120 --> 23:55.560
After this battle,
you'll serve in the Imperial Guard.

23:55.640 --> 23:56.840
So cool.

23:56.920 --> 23:58.040
- That's amazing.
- The Emperor's guard.

23:58.120 --> 24:00.080
General, I'd like to open
a blacksmith shop.

24:00.680 --> 24:02.400
General, I…

24:02.480 --> 24:04.040
What do you want?

24:04.120 --> 24:05.680
I want ten gold pieces.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.880
Wishful thinking.

24:08.960 --> 24:10.440
Ten pieces, huh?

24:10.520 --> 24:11.360
Zhang,

24:11.440 --> 24:13.120
I certainly know what you want.

24:13.200 --> 24:14.600
- What do I want?
- You just want a child

24:14.680 --> 24:16.120
with the girl next door.

24:18.240 --> 24:21.320
The general can't help with that.

24:21.400 --> 24:24.360
- General Qingyan, what about you?
- Yeah.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.480
What do you want?

24:25.560 --> 24:27.240
Qingyan, write down your wish, too.

24:28.360 --> 24:29.200
Me?

24:30.280 --> 24:32.120
I only wish to stay by Prince Jing's side.

24:32.200 --> 24:33.440
This is a great moment

24:33.520 --> 24:34.920
to secure something
for your family, isn't it?

24:35.000 --> 24:36.440
Yeah, General Qingyan.

24:38.040 --> 24:40.400
I'm an orphan. I've followed
Prince Jing since childhood.

24:40.480 --> 24:41.680
He is my family.

24:42.320 --> 24:43.840
You don't understand.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.920
Following him, you can have everything.

24:50.280 --> 24:51.920
General, what about you?

24:52.000 --> 24:53.800
Yeah, General. What do you want?

24:53.880 --> 24:55.960
Yeah, General.

24:56.040 --> 24:58.000
What do you want?

25:02.120 --> 25:03.880
I wish to be her in-house husband.

25:07.000 --> 25:08.160
Bravo!

25:10.520 --> 25:12.120
‪Bravo, General.

25:13.760 --> 25:15.360
Miss Hua, did you hear that?

25:16.120 --> 25:19.280
Say yes!

25:19.360 --> 25:20.920
Say yes!

25:21.000 --> 25:24.880
Say yes!

25:24.960 --> 25:30.320
Say yes!

25:30.920 --> 25:31.960
Yes.

25:46.360 --> 25:48.800
And your wish, Miss Hua?

25:56.560 --> 25:58.920
To see snow in Qingzhou again.

26:49.800 --> 26:51.160
As you suspected,

26:51.880 --> 26:53.320
Mingju led his troops
to Qingzhou overnight.

26:54.440 --> 26:55.560
When shall we strike?

26:56.640 --> 26:59.880
Before Mingju returns,
burn their supply camp

26:59.960 --> 27:01.840
and destroy the siege cannons.

27:03.160 --> 27:04.240
Yes.

28:09.920 --> 28:12.640
Great Yan's sneak attack! Charge!

28:21.480 --> 28:24.960
- Kill them!
- Kill them!

29:28.240 --> 29:29.280
The Great Yan army launched
a sneak attack.

29:29.360 --> 29:30.680
Hurry and fight them!

29:30.760 --> 29:33.440
Don't worry, Your Highness. We will
protect Your Highness at all costs!

29:43.600 --> 29:46.440
- You can't, Your Highness!
- Are you stopping me again?

29:47.720 --> 29:50.240
Your Highness, in the past,

29:50.320 --> 29:52.800
I ignored your wishes,
thinking I knew best.

29:53.920 --> 29:55.640
I will distract them for Your Highness.

29:55.720 --> 29:57.520
You can escape amidst the chaos.

29:59.480 --> 30:00.320
Thank you.

30:05.040 --> 30:07.080
Your Highness!
The Prince Heir has escaped.

30:27.080 --> 30:29.360
- Cover me.
- Cover the general!

30:29.440 --> 30:30.960
- Yes.
- Yes.

30:38.640 --> 30:39.680
My lord.

30:43.640 --> 30:44.960
Release the arrows!

33:17.800 --> 33:19.920
Qingzhou needs General.

33:20.720 --> 33:23.240
General, go!

33:23.320 --> 33:25.840
Qingzhou cannot do without you!

33:36.040 --> 33:37.360
Qingyan!

33:59.680 --> 34:02.120
Qingyan, report for duty!

34:51.600 --> 34:52.960
The general will surely return.

34:55.360 --> 34:57.680
Night's cold. Miss, please stop waiting.

34:58.840 --> 34:59.840
I want to wait for him.

35:24.560 --> 35:25.520
Qingyan.

35:27.480 --> 35:28.600
Qingyan.

35:30.640 --> 35:31.680
Qingyan.

35:33.880 --> 35:36.200
Qingyan.

35:50.800 --> 35:53.120
Qingyan.

36:16.560 --> 36:17.720
Hurry and go!

36:54.880 --> 36:56.600
General Weibei has returned!

36:56.680 --> 36:59.880
General Weibei has returned!

37:05.080 --> 37:11.800
QINGZHOU

37:18.680 --> 37:19.680
I…

37:20.640 --> 37:22.640
I only wish to stay by Prince Jing's side.

37:22.720 --> 37:23.800
I'm an orphan.

37:23.880 --> 37:25.320
I've followed Prince Jing since childhood.

37:25.400 --> 37:26.400
He is my family.

37:26.480 --> 37:28.320
Following him, you can have everything.

39:52.360 --> 39:53.200
Jinghe,

39:55.160 --> 39:56.840
you have held back the Xiyan army.

39:58.240 --> 39:59.920
We'll await reinforcements.

40:12.880 --> 40:15.640
Don't shoot arrows. It's General Yin.
General Yin is back.

40:29.480 --> 40:30.720
Luomei.

40:51.000 --> 40:54.480
QINGZHOU

40:54.560 --> 40:56.280
- General Yin.
- Luomei.

40:56.360 --> 40:57.440
General Weibei,

40:58.080 --> 41:00.600
50,000 reinforcements have arrived.

41:01.600 --> 41:04.120
Yin Luomei, report for duty!

41:08.040 --> 41:09.520
- General Yin.
- Luomei.

41:09.600 --> 41:11.040
The general's eye was poisoned.

41:11.120 --> 41:13.280
To halt the toxin's spread
and avoid delaying operations, she…

41:13.360 --> 41:14.360
she removed her own eye.

41:29.720 --> 41:30.800
The reinforcements are here.

41:30.880 --> 41:32.520
- Retreat!
- Retreat!

41:32.600 --> 41:35.080
Report! General,
our reinforcements have arrived.

41:35.160 --> 41:36.160
Mingju is fleeing.

41:38.520 --> 41:39.440
- Everyone, back to defenses!
- Yes.

41:39.520 --> 41:40.440
Hand me the spear!

41:47.680 --> 41:48.920
Open the gate!

42:50.480 --> 42:52.280
Xiyan soldiers, heed me!

42:54.080 --> 42:55.600
I'll lead you home!

44:42.440 --> 44:43.400
Mei.

44:44.320 --> 44:46.440
Mei, what's wrong?

44:51.000 --> 44:52.560
Mei. Mei, wake up.

44:52.640 --> 44:53.680
